# Regenerable simulated eval data (80 run binaries + 80 per-run prediction
# JSON files + manifest): regenerate with, in order,
#   python/generate_eval_runs.py       (writes data/eval_runs/*.bin + manifest.json + scripts/_wsl_run_eval_generated.sh)
#   bash scripts/_wsl_run_eval_generated.sh   (run from WSL, invokes the built edge_scorer once per run)
#   python/compute_eval_metrics.py     (writes docs/eval_output.txt + docs/eval_summary.json)
#   python/build_console_sample.py     (writes react-console/public/sample_predictions.json)
data/eval_runs/

# generated one-off helper script (recreated by python/generate_eval_runs.py)
scripts/_wsl_run_eval_generated.sh
